WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.372 --> 00:00:02.308
(rock music fading out)

00:00:02.308 --> 00:00:03.660
- All right, oh my gosh.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:04.860
Give it up for the band!

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:08.475
(audience cheering)

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:09.360
Oh my gosh.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.390
I always like to close
out with one last story

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.380
I hope that you'll enjoy.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.394
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:14.394 --> 00:00:17.280
(rock music)

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.470
I'm so excited to now be
living here in New York.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.430
You have no idea.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.350
It's the largest understatement ever,

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:23.670
but I am not the only one.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.503
Y'all are loving it here?

00:00:24.503 --> 00:00:25.868
People are having a good time, right?

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:27.882
Yes, yes.
(audience cheering)

00:00:27.882 --> 00:00:28.715
All right.

00:00:28.715 --> 00:00:30.346
That made me feel really
good when people said that,

00:00:30.346 --> 00:00:31.746
'cause this was my decision.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.200
Just could of gone poorly.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.660
A few days ago though,
our Vocal Director, Jessi

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.660
had a magical moment
walking down the street.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:43.020
Our Senior Supervising Digital
Producer, Andy caught it

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:47.970
in its full glory and I
made her let me play it.

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:51.422
Check out this gem Jessi
posted on Instagram.

00:00:51.422 --> 00:00:52.255
- Da, da, seven, hit.

00:00:54.391 --> 00:00:57.087
It's five, six, seven, eight.

00:00:57.087 --> 00:00:59.375
It's a one, two, three.

00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:03.103
- [Crowd] Hey, hey,
hey, hey, hey, hey, hey,

00:01:03.103 --> 00:01:04.686
hey, hey, hey, hey.

00:01:06.402 --> 00:01:09.275
- Welcome to New York, baby!

00:01:09.275 --> 00:01:11.287
(people cheering)

00:01:11.287 --> 00:01:14.190
- My favorite thing ever.

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:16.787
(audience clapping)

00:01:16.787 --> 00:01:20.647
She showed me this and
I was like, "Oh my gosh,

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.840
"I love New York so much."

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:22.673
What happened?

00:01:22.673 --> 00:01:23.607
Those were strangers.

00:01:23.607 --> 00:01:25.126
- Those were strangers.

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:27.090
Andy...(laughs)

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.280
Andy and I went out for a drink.

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.113
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:01:30.113 --> 00:01:32.670
- But like a place on his block.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.560
And we walked in, we were
just getting like a drink

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.300
with his friends that were in town

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.580
and we walked in and it
was a full drag show.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.382
So obviously, we stayed.

00:01:40.382 --> 00:01:41.215
(audience laughing)

00:01:41.215 --> 00:01:45.690
And anyway, so then I left
and we were in the street

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.333
and I wasn't sober.
- And you were on a stage.

00:01:48.872 --> 00:01:49.705
(audience laughing)

00:01:49.705 --> 00:01:51.600
- And I was just practicing
my best drag walk.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.310
And then next thing I know

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.960
there was a whole crowd
of people cheering me on.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.460
- I love New York.

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:57.293
- [Jessi] It's the best.

00:01:57.293 --> 00:01:59.326
- Those were perfect strangers.

00:01:59.326 --> 00:02:00.514
- It's the best.

00:02:00.514 --> 00:02:01.347
(audience cheering)

00:02:01.347 --> 00:02:03.810
- Thank you, Jessi, for
allowing me to play that.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.010
I love it so much.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:07.140
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.250
Now around this point

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.260
we usually give our guest $1,000

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.270
courtesy of our season
long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.070
makers of FriXion, the go to erasable pen

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:15.150
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show."

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.550
And I know that Jess
is like, "Wait, what?"

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:20.100
But sadly, we are not able to give that

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.570
to people who work here.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:22.403
- [Jessi] Oh.

00:02:22.403 --> 00:02:24.690
- So I'm gonna buy her a really nice gift.

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:27.390
So, their loss is going to be the gain

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:28.620
for someone in the audience though.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.350
So I want you to look at the monitor

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.300
and our cameras are
gonna do a little magic

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.580
and one of your faces is
gonna show up right there.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:36.413
So, okay.

00:02:36.413 --> 00:02:37.473
Hit it, let's do it.

00:02:37.473 --> 00:02:39.322
(drumroll)

00:02:39.322 --> 00:02:41.191
Who's face, who's face, who's face?

00:02:41.191 --> 00:02:44.191
(audience cheering)

00:02:47.075 --> 00:02:49.825
(exciting music)

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:55.650
Your eyes got so big.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:56.490
What's your name?

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:57.323
- Louie.

00:02:57.323 --> 00:02:58.156
- Louie.

00:02:58.156 --> 00:02:58.989
What's up?

00:02:58.989 --> 00:03:00.570
What are you gonna do do with the grand?

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.781
- Go on vacation with my fiance.

00:03:02.781 --> 00:03:05.655
- Yes!
(audience cheering)

00:03:05.655 --> 00:03:06.655
I love that.

00:03:07.831 --> 00:03:09.870
Well, have such a beautiful life together.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:12.000
Thank y'all for coming
and congrats on the grand.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:12.833
- Thank you so much.

00:03:12.833 --> 00:03:14.700
We're such huge fans.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:15.533
We love you.

00:03:15.533 --> 00:03:16.366
- Oh, thank you.

00:03:16.366 --> 00:03:17.199
I'm a fan of Jessi's right now.

00:03:17.199 --> 00:03:18.239
- [Louie] Yes ma'am.

00:03:18.239 --> 00:03:20.550
- Thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.420
Sam Heughan, Jana Kramer,
Matthew and Grace and Camila.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:25.530
Y'all have a great day

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:27.630
and if it's not, try and change it.

